abstract: >
  Focused geometry-field extension located in the she-geofield subdirectory
  of the S.H.E. repository, implementing curvature-driven simplex-weight
  evolution, weighted Hodge diffusion, and the toy bridge-complex experiment
  supporting the companion article.
